{"product_id":"teaching-assistants-handbook","title":"Teaching Assistant's Handbook","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis practical, comprehensive and accessible handbook is fully in line with the latest NVQ framework Levels 2 and 3 for teaching assistants, and an essential resource for both new and experienced teaching assistants. The handbook covers: promoting safety and security of pupils; preparing classroom resources and records; managing behaviour; and using ICT to support learning. It also covers the theoretical aspects of child development in the classroom including: social and emotional development; cognition and learning difficulties; language and communication. It provides vital information on career development for the teaching assistant, such as how to support teachers effectively; working with colleagues as part of a team; liaising with parents; reviewing your own professional practice and progressing your career. With detailed information on all this and more, the \"Teaching Assistant's Handbook\" is an essential resource for all those training or working in this rapidly growing field.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 157 x 232\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Teena Kamen\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780340811238\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45726790385817,"sku":"15RD-49780340811238","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68c96c00a0d7b_Teaching_Assistant_s_Handbook_Teena_Kamen.jpg?v=1758090353","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/teaching-assistants-handbook","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}